-- for a NEW migrations folder; it supersedes supabase/migrations/ as the
-- source of truth for schema shape (that directory can no longer rebuild the
-- live schema — 206 migrations are applied against 145 distinct versions on
-- disk).
--
-- Cut commit ......: 484548bed55a086e55c0af0d1c3509747f0f54de
