-- 13c. Functions (16)
COMMENT ON FUNCTION public.assert_active_super_admin_exists() IS 'Enforces Residio''s bootstrap invariant (ADR-0007, issue #184): at least one profile with approval_status = ''active'' must hold the super_admin role. Attached as a deferred constraint trigger to public.profiles (DELETE, UPDATE OF role_id/approval_status) and public.app_roles (DELETE), so the check runs at COMMIT against the transaction''s final state and handing the role between administrators inside one transaction is allowed.';
COMMENT ON FUNCTION public.get_effective_dashboard_theme(user_profile_id uuid) IS 'Returns the effective dashboard theme for a user (override → estate default → nahid). Available themes: nahid, paier';
COMMENT ON FUNCTION public.get_effective_portal_theme(user_profile_id uuid) IS 'Returns the effective portal theme for a user (override → estate default → nahid). Available themes: nahid, paier';
COMMENT ON FUNCTION public.get_effective_setting(p_setting_key text, p_house_id uuid, p_resident_id uuid) IS 'Resolves setting value using cascade: resident -> house -> estate';
COMMENT ON FUNCTION public.get_my_resident_id() IS 'Resident linked to the current user, or NULL if unlinked or not an approved account.';
COMMENT ON FUNCTION public.get_primary_occupier(p_house_id uuid) IS 'Get the primary occupier (owner-occupier or tenant) for approval notifications';
COMMENT ON FUNCTION public.get_setting_overrides(p_setting_key text) IS 'Returns all configured values for a setting across all levels';
COMMENT ON FUNCTION public.handle_new_user() IS 'Provisions a public.profiles row for each new auth.users row. Deliberately ignores
raw_user_meta_data->>''role'': that value is client-supplied and was a privilege-escalation
vector. New accounts start pending with no role and gain access only via administrator
approval.';
COMMENT ON FUNCTION public.is_approved() IS 'TRUE when the current user holds an approved (active) account, regardless of which
role they have. Used by RESTRICTIVE policies on reference and configuration tables whose
permissive policies do not otherwise reference the user.';
COMMENT ON FUNCTION public.is_resident() IS 'TRUE only for an approved account linked to a resident record.';
COMMENT ON FUNCTION public.is_role_assignment_allowed(p_user_id uuid, p_app_role_id uuid) IS 'Checks if a specific role can be assigned to a user based on their resident type';
COMMENT ON FUNCTION public.is_super_admin() IS 'TRUE only for an approved account holding the super_admin role.';
COMMENT ON FUNCTION public.process_expired_approvals() IS 'Auto-reject pending approvals that have expired (72-hour timeout)';
COMMENT ON FUNCTION public.replace_whatsapp_credentials(p_provider text, p_access_token_encrypted text, p_verify_token_encrypted text, p_app_secret_encrypted text, p_phone_number_id text, p_api_version text, p_graph_base_url text, p_account_sid_encrypted text, p_auth_token_encrypted text, p_whatsapp_from_number text, p_template_content_sids jsonb, p_actor_id uuid) IS 'Atomically deactivates the current active credential row and inserts its replacement, so messaging cannot be left with zero active rows mid-rotation.';
COMMENT ON FUNCTION public.requires_approval_for_action(p_house_id uuid, p_requester_resident_id uuid, p_action_type text) IS 'Check if a developer/owner action requires approval from occupier';
COMMENT ON FUNCTION public.validate_corporate_role() IS 'Corporate entities may own, develop, or be the active billable tenant of a house.';

